        remotePromptId: 
      errorSystemMessage: 
      userPrompt: 
      TicketPrompt: "Fix the active word-choice scene\u2019s outdoor sunrise landscape.
        The conifer meshes are malformed or incorrectly oriented, appearing as flattened
        dark layers across the upper-right horizon. Correct or replace the conifers
        so three distinct upright tree silhouettes stand with their bases on the
        ground in a readable right-side background cluster behind the word-choice
        gameplay. Keep the broad ground plane, and position the large boulder slightly
        farther back beside or behind the cluster. Ensure none of this scenery obstructs
        the word-choice display or its routes."
      ChatResponses:
        Answers:
        - Content: "The active word-choice scene\u2019s outdoor sunrise landscape
            was repaired. The malformed conifers were replaced with three upright,
            grounded tree silhouettes arranged as a staggered background cluster
            on the right, while the broad ground plane and gameplay visibility were
            preserved.\n\n## Changes made\n\n- **Conifers:** Added visible trunks
            and layered evergreen canopies with varied heights, widths, rotations,
            and depth placement.\n- **Composition:** Positioned the trees behind
            the word-choice display so the center word, category labels, and travel
            routes remained unobstructed.\n- **Boulder:** Moved and scaled the boulder
            slightly farther back beside the tree cluster, with its base grounded
            on the plane.\n- **Lighting:** Kept the scenery compatible with the existing
            success-driven sunrise, allowing the trees and boulder to read as silhouettes
            in darkness and gain warm definition as the scene brightened."
          SecondsSincePrevious: 0
          GeneratedAtTicks: 0
          ResponseType: 3
          Source: 
