      userPrompt: I'd like to adjust _GAMEPLAY object to the current scene and Camera
        1. candidate should appear in front of the camera, LeftCategory should be
        slightly above the groundmesh, with LeftTargeton the groundmesh, RightTarget
        similarily on the right, so they are in front of all the tree objects in
        the scene.
      TicketPrompt: In the active scene, adjust the existing `_GAMEPLAY` word-choice
        objects for Camera 1. Place the candidate clearly in front of the camera.
        Position `LeftCategory` slightly above the ground mesh with `LeftTarget`
        resting on the ground mesh to its left, and stage `RightTarget` equivalently
        on the right. Ensure the candidate, categories, and targets are visibly in
        front of all tree objects in the scene.
