      ChatHistory:
        Messages:
        - Question: "Fix the active word-choice scene\u2019s outdoor sunrise landscape.
            The conifer meshes are malformed or incorrectly oriented, appearing as
            flattened dark layers across the upper-right horizon. Correct or replace
            the conifers so three distinct upright tree silhouettes stand with their
            bases on the ground in a readable right-side background cluster behind
