            Name: "Determine how the word-choice logic references candidate, Le\u2026"
            State: 0
            Status: 0
            StopReason: 
            OriginTask: Determine how the word-choice logic references candidate,
              LeftTarget, RightTarget, and categories, and whether repositioning
              their transforms alone preserves the selection flight behavior. Identify
              any spatial assumptions relevant to this layout correction.
            CrawlCount: 1
            SystemMap:
